@startuml 使用案例2_3_收容所送養發佈
title 使用案例2.3: 收容所送養發佈

actor "收容所會員" as User
participant "RehomeForm.vue" as RehomeFormPage
participant "FileUploader.vue" as FileUploader
participant "animals.ts" as AnimalAPI
participant "uploads.ts" as UploadAPI
participant "animals.py(blueprint)" as AnimalBlueprint
participant "uploads.py(blueprint)" as UploadBlueprint
participant "animal_service.py" as AnimalService
participant "animal.py(model)" as AnimalModel
participant "others.py(Attachment)(model)" as AttachmentModel
participant "user.py(model)" as UserModel
participant "shelter.py(model)" as ShelterModel
database "MySQL" as DB
participant "MinIO" as Storage

== 1. 進入送養發佈頁面 ==
User -> RehomeFormPage: 訪問 /rehome-form
activate RehomeFormPage
RehomeFormPage -> RehomeFormPage: onMounted()\\n檢查使用者角色
RehomeFormPage -> RehomeFormPage: authStore.user.role == 'SHELTER_MEMBER'

alt 收容所會員
    RehomeFormPage -> RehomeFormPage: 顯示收容所會員提示框
    note right
      提示內容:
      - 此動物歸屬於收容所機構
      - 可在「收容所動物管理」批次操作
      - 如需批次匯入，使用收容所管理功能
    end note
    RehomeFormPage --> User: 顯示單次送養表單\\n+ 收容所會員提示
end

RehomeFormPage -> RehomeFormPage: 初始化表單\\ncurrentStep = 0\\nformData = {}
RehomeFormPage --> User: 顯示步驟 1: 基本資訊表單
deactivate RehomeFormPage

== 2. 填寫動物基本資訊 ==
User -> RehomeFormPage: 填寫基本資訊
activate RehomeFormPage
note right
  必填欄位:
  - name (名稱)
  - species (物種: CAT/DOG)
  - breed (品種)
  - sex (性別: MALE/FEMALE)
  - dob (出生日期)
  
  選填欄位:
  - color (顏色)
  - description (描述)
end note
RehomeFormPage -> RehomeFormPage: 即時驗證欄位

User -> RehomeFormPage: 點擊「下一步」
RehomeFormPage -> RehomeFormPage: validateStep(0)\\n檢查必填欄位
alt 驗證失敗
    RehomeFormPage --> User: 顯示錯誤訊息
else 驗證通過
    RehomeFormPage -> RehomeFormPage: currentStep = 1
    RehomeFormPage --> User: 顯示步驟 2: 健康狀況表單
end
deactivate RehomeFormPage

== 3. 填寫健康狀況 ==
User -> RehomeFormPage: 填寫健康狀況
activate RehomeFormPage
note right
  欄位:
  - medical_summary (健康摘要)
  - is_neutered (是否絕育)
end note

User -> RehomeFormPage: 點擊「下一步」
RehomeFormPage -> RehomeFormPage: nextStep() 驗證
alt 驗證失敗 (name, species, sex, description 任一未填)
    RehomeFormPage -> RehomeFormPage: errorMessage = '請填寫所有必填欄位'
    RehomeFormPage --> User: 顯示錯誤訊息
else 驗證通過
    RehomeFormPage -> RehomeFormPage: currentStep = 2
    RehomeFormPage --> User: 顯示步驟 3: 照片上傳
end
deactivate RehomeFormPage

== 4. 上傳動物照片 ==
User -> RehomeFormPage: 選擇照片檔案
activate RehomeFormPage
RehomeFormPage -> FileUploader: 處理檔案選擇
activate FileUploader
FileUploader -> FileUploader: 驗證檔案\\n(格式、大小、數量)
note right
  檔案驗證:
  - 格式: JPG, PNG
  - 大小: 最大 5MB/檔
  - 數量: 最多 10 張
end note

alt 驗證失敗
    FileUploader --> RehomeFormPage: onUploadError(error)
    RehomeFormPage --> User: 顯示錯誤訊息
else 驗證通過
    FileUploader -> FileUploader: files.push(file)\\n預覽圖片
    FileUploader --> RehomeFormPage: 檔案已加入列表
    deactivate FileUploader
    RehomeFormPage --> User: 顯示照片預覽
end

User -> RehomeFormPage: 點擊「下一步」
RehomeFormPage -> RehomeFormPage: nextStep() 驗證
alt 新增模式且無照片
    RehomeFormPage -> RehomeFormPage: errorMessage = '請至少選擇一張照片'
    RehomeFormPage --> User: 顯示錯誤訊息
else 有照片或編輯模式
    RehomeFormPage -> RehomeFormPage: currentStep = 3
    RehomeFormPage --> User: 顯示步驟 4: 確認送出
end
deactivate RehomeFormPage

== 5. 確認並提交 ==
User -> RehomeFormPage: 檢視資料摘要
User -> RehomeFormPage: 點擊「提交發佈」
activate RehomeFormPage
RehomeFormPage -> RehomeFormPage: handleSubmit()\\nisSubmitting = true

== 6. 創建動物記錄 ==
RehomeFormPage -> AnimalAPI: createAnimal(animalData)
activate AnimalAPI
note right
  animalData:
  {
    name, species, breed,
    color, sex, dob,
    description, medical_summary,
    status: 'DRAFT'
  }
end note
AnimalAPI -> AnimalBlueprint: POST /animals
activate AnimalBlueprint

AnimalBlueprint -> AnimalBlueprint: @jwt_required()\\n取得 current_user_id
AnimalBlueprint -> UserModel: User.query.get(current_user_id)
activate UserModel
UserModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM users\\nWHERE user_id = :id
activate DB
DB --> UserModel: 使用者資料
deactivate DB
UserModel --> AnimalBlueprint: User 物件
deactivate UserModel

AnimalBlueprint -> AnimalService: create_animal(user, data)
activate AnimalService

== 7. 判斷動物歸屬 ==
AnimalService -> AnimalService: 檢查使用者角色

alt user.role == SHELTER_MEMBER && user.primary_shelter_id
    AnimalService -> AnimalService: 設定為收容所動物\\nshelter_id = user.primary_shelter_id\\nowner_id = None
    note right
      收容所動物特性:
      - 歸屬於收容所機構
      - 不需管理員審核
      - 可直接發布
    end note
else user.role == ADMIN && data.shelter_id
    AnimalService -> AnimalService: 管理員指定收容所\\nshelter_id = data.shelter_id\\nowner_id = None
else 其他情況
    AnimalService -> AnimalService: 設定為個人送養\\nshelter_id = None\\nowner_id = user.user_id
end

== 8. 創建動物資料 ==
AnimalService -> AnimalService: 組裝 Animal 物件\\nstatus = DRAFT\\ncreated_by = user.user_id

AnimalService -> AnimalService: 驗證互斥條件\\nowner_id 與 shelter_id 不能同時存在
alt 驗證失敗
    AnimalService --> AnimalBlueprint: ValidationError:\\n'owner_id 與 shelter_id 不能同時存在'
    AnimalBlueprint --> AnimalAPI: 400 Bad Request
    AnimalAPI --> RehomeFormPage: 錯誤訊息
    RehomeFormPage --> User: alert('發佈失敗')
end

AnimalService -> AnimalModel: Animal(...)\ndb.session.add(animal)
activate AnimalModel
AnimalModel -> DB: INSERT INTO animals\\n(name, species, breed, sex, dob,\\n shelter_id, owner_id, status,\\n created_by, ...)\\nVALUES (...)
activate DB
note right
  收容所動物:
  - shelter_id = :shelter_id
  - owner_id = NULL
  - status = 'DRAFT'
  - created_by = :user_id
end note
DB --> AnimalModel: 插入成功，返回 animal_id
deactivate DB
AnimalModel --> AnimalService: Animal 物件
deactivate AnimalModel

AnimalService -> AnimalModel: db.session.commit()
activate AnimalModel
AnimalModel -> DB: COMMIT
activate DB
DB --> AnimalModel: 提交成功
deactivate DB
AnimalModel --> AnimalService: 完成
deactivate AnimalModel

AnimalService --> AnimalBlueprint: Animal 物件
deactivate AnimalService

AnimalBlueprint -> AnimalBlueprint: animal.to_dict()
AnimalBlueprint --> AnimalAPI: 201 Created\\n{message, animal: {...}}
deactivate AnimalBlueprint
AnimalAPI --> RehomeFormPage: {animal: {animal_id, ...}}
deactivate AnimalAPI

RehomeFormPage -> RehomeFormPage: animalId = response.animal.animal_id

== 9. 上傳照片 ==
alt 有選擇照片 (uploaderFiles.length > 0)
    loop 每張照片
        RehomeFormPage -> UploadAPI: uploadMultiple(files, 'ANIMAL', animalId)
        activate UploadAPI
        
        UploadAPI -> UploadBlueprint: POST /uploads/presigned-url
        activate UploadBlueprint
        UploadBlueprint -> UploadBlueprint: 生成預簽名 URL
        UploadBlueprint --> UploadAPI: {upload_url, storage_key}
        deactivate UploadBlueprint
        
        UploadAPI -> Storage: PUT upload_url\\n(直接上傳檔案)
        activate Storage
        Storage --> UploadAPI: 上傳成功
        deactivate Storage
        
        UploadAPI -> UploadBlueprint: POST /uploads/confirm
        activate UploadBlueprint
        UploadBlueprint --> UploadAPI: {url, storage_key, mime_type}
        deactivate UploadBlueprint
        UploadAPI --> RehomeFormPage: uploadResults[]
        deactivate UploadAPI
        
        RehomeFormPage -> AnimalAPI: addAnimalImage(animalId, imageData)
        activate AnimalAPI
        note right
          imageData:
          {
            image_url: result.url,
            storage_key: result.storage_key,
            mime_type: result.mime_type
          }
        end note
        AnimalAPI -> AnimalBlueprint: POST /animals/:id/images
        activate AnimalBlueprint
        
        AnimalBlueprint -> AnimalService: add_image(animal_id, user, ...)
        activate AnimalService
        
        AnimalService -> AttachmentModel: Attachment(...)\\ndb.session.add(attachment)
        activate AttachmentModel
        AttachmentModel -> DB: INSERT INTO attachments\\n(owner_type='animal',\\n owner_id=:animal_id,\\n storage_key, url, mime_type, ...)\\nVALUES (...)
        activate DB
        DB --> AttachmentModel: 插入成功
        deactivate DB
        AttachmentModel --> AnimalService: Attachment 物件
        deactivate AttachmentModel
        
        AnimalService -> AttachmentModel: db.session.commit()
        activate AttachmentModel
        AttachmentModel -> DB: COMMIT
        activate DB
        DB --> AttachmentModel: 提交成功
        deactivate DB
        AttachmentModel --> AnimalService: 完成
        deactivate AttachmentModel
        
        AnimalService --> AnimalBlueprint: Attachment 物件
        deactivate AnimalService
        AnimalBlueprint --> AnimalAPI: 201 Created {message, image}
        deactivate AnimalBlueprint
        AnimalAPI --> RehomeFormPage: 圖片已新增
        deactivate AnimalAPI
    end
end

== 10. 提交審核 (收容所動物與個人送養相同流程) ==
RehomeFormPage -> AnimalAPI: submitAnimal(animalId)
activate AnimalAPI
note right
  ⚠️ 收容所動物沒有自動發布特權
  狀態: DRAFT → SUBMITTED
  需等待管理員審核通過才會變成 PUBLISHED
end note
AnimalAPI -> AnimalBlueprint: POST /animals/:id/submit
activate AnimalBlueprint

AnimalBlueprint -> AnimalService: submit_animal(animal_id, user)
activate AnimalService

AnimalService -> AnimalModel: Animal.query.filter_by(animal_id).first()
activate AnimalModel
AnimalModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM animals WHERE animal_id = :id
activate DB
DB --> AnimalModel: 動物資料
deactivate DB
AnimalModel --> AnimalService: Animal 物件
deactivate AnimalModel

AnimalService -> AnimalService: 驗證狀態 (必須為 DRAFT)
AnimalService -> AnimalService: animal.status = SUBMITTED
AnimalService -> AnimalModel: db.session.commit()
activate AnimalModel
AnimalModel -> DB: UPDATE animals\\nSET status = 'SUBMITTED',\\n    updated_at = NOW()\\nWHERE animal_id = :id
activate DB
note right
  收容所動物狀態流程:
  DRAFT → SUBMITTED → (管理員審核) → PUBLISHED
  與個人送養完全相同
end note
DB --> AnimalModel: 更新成功
deactivate DB
AnimalModel --> AnimalService: 完成
deactivate AnimalModel

AnimalService --> AnimalBlueprint: Animal 物件
deactivate AnimalService
AnimalBlueprint --> AnimalAPI: 200 OK {message, animal}
deactivate AnimalBlueprint
AnimalAPI --> RehomeFormPage: 提交成功
deactivate AnimalAPI

== 11. 完成並導向 ==
RehomeFormPage -> RehomeFormPage: isSubmitting = false
RehomeFormPage -> RehomeFormPage: 清除草稿\\nlocalStorage.removeItem('rehome_draft')
RehomeFormPage -> RehomeFormPage: submissionSuccess = true

RehomeFormPage --> User: 顯示成功訊息
note right
  收容所動物成功訊息:
  「送養資訊已建立並提交審核成功!
   審核通過後將會公開顯示。」
  
  ⚠️ 注意: 不是「已發布」而是「已提交審核」
  狀態為 SUBMITTED,需等待管理員批准
end note

opt 使用者選擇導向目標
    alt 點擊「前往收容所動物管理」
        RehomeFormPage -> RehomeFormPage: router.push('/shelter/animals')
        RehomeFormPage --> User: 導向「收容所動物管理」頁面
    else 點擊「返回首頁」或其他
        RehomeFormPage --> User: 停留在成功頁面
    end
end
deactivate RehomeFormPage

== 12. 替代流程 - 儲存草稿 ==
opt 使用者儲存草稿
    User -> RehomeFormPage: 點擊「儲存草稿」按鈕
    activate RehomeFormPage
    RehomeFormPage -> RehomeFormPage: saveDraft()\\n基本驗證 (name, species)
    
    alt 驗證失敗
        RehomeFormPage --> User: alert('請至少填寫動物名稱和物種')
    else 驗證通過
        RehomeFormPage -> AnimalAPI: createAnimal(animalData)
        note right
          與步驟 6-8 相同流程
          狀態保持為 DRAFT
        end note
        AnimalAPI --> RehomeFormPage: {animal: {animal_id, ...}}
        
        RehomeFormPage -> RehomeFormPage: 儲存草稿資訊\nlocalStorage.setItem('rehome_draft', ...)
        RehomeFormPage -> RehomeFormPage: router.replace({ query: { id: animalId } })
        RehomeFormPage --> User: alert('草稿已儲存到資料庫')\n導向編輯模式
    end
    deactivate RehomeFormPage
end

== 13. 替代流程 - 前往收容所管理 ==
opt 收容所會員選擇批次操作
    User -> RehomeFormPage: 點擊「前往收容所動物管理」
    activate RehomeFormPage
    RehomeFormPage -> RehomeFormPage: router.push('/shelter/animals')
    RehomeFormPage --> User: 導向收容所動物管理頁面
    note right
      收容所管理功能:
      - 批次上傳動物
      - 批次管理狀態
      - 查看所有收容所動物
    end note
    deactivate RehomeFormPage
end

note over User, DB
  **後置條件:**
  1. 動物記錄已創建於資料庫
  2. 收容所動物: shelter_id 已設定, owner_id 為 NULL
  3. 個人送養: owner_id 已設定, shelter_id 為 NULL
  4. 照片已上傳至 MinIO 並記錄於 attachments 表
  5. 動物狀態為 SUBMITTED (已提交審核,等待管理員批准)
  6. 暫存的醫療記錄已批次創建至資料庫
  
  **收容所動物特性 (非自動發布特權):**
  - ✅ 歸屬於收容所機構 (shelter_id, owner_id = NULL)
  - ✅ 可在收容所管理後台批次操作 (ShelterAnimals.vue)
  - ✅ 支援批次匯入功能 (使用案例 2.3.1)
  - ❌ 不會自動發布,狀態流程與個人送養相同:
       DRAFT → SUBMITTED → (管理員審核) → PUBLISHED
  
  **資料驗證:**
  - owner_id 與 shelter_id 互斥 (不能同時存在)
  - 照片格式: JPG, PNG (最大 5MB, 最多 10 張)
  - 必填欄位: name, species, sex, description (步驟1驗證)
  - 照片必須: 新增模式至少1張 (步驟2驗證)
  
  **檔案上傳流程:**
  - 前端  取得預簽名 URL
  - 前端  直接上傳至 MinIO
  - 前端  確認上傳並取得 URL
  - 前端  建立 Attachment 記錄
  
  **替代方案:**
  - 儲存草稿: 隨時儲存進度 (狀態保持 DRAFT)
  - 批次匯入: 使用收容所管理功能 (使用案例 2.3.1)
  - 編輯模式: 可修改已儲存的草稿或 SUBMITTED 狀態的動物
end note

@enduml
